{{!-- Shared derived-stat row: `base (calculated, grey) + modifier (editable,
      white) = total (grey)` — the design handoff's §1 "cálculo com modificador"
      pattern, used by every window that shows a derived number (character
      Defences and Movement, unit Defence/Discipline/Movement/Power Cost).

      `note` carries the REAL formula under the label: the prototype printed the
      marker `[código: informar fórmula do cálculo]` there precisely so the code
      would replace it (handoff §1, "Notas de fórmula — AÇÃO DO CÓDIGO").

      A resource with a current value does NOT belong here — it uses
      resource-row.hbs (`CURRENT / max`), which is what replaced the old trailing
      blue "current" chip (handoff §4).

      The base and the total carry NO `name`: since v13 a readonly input IS
      submitted, and a derived value with a name would be written straight back
      into the document. The one editable field is the owner's adjustment. --}}
<div class="cs2-stat-row">
    <div class="cs2-stat-head">
        <span class="cs2-stat-label">{{label}}</span>
        {{#if note}}<span class="cs2-stat-note">{{note}}</span>{{/if}}
    </div>
    <div class="cs2-stat-fields">
        <input type="text" value="{{value}}" title="{{localize 'CS.sheets.generalLabels.base'}}" readonly="readonly"/>
        <span class="cs2-op">+</span>
        <input name="{{modifierName}}" type="text" value="{{modifierValue}}" title="{{localize 'CS.sheets.generalLabels.ownerAdjustment'}}" data-dtype="Number"/>
        <span class="cs2-op">=</span>
        <span class="cs2-total">{{total}}</span>
    </div>
</div>
